WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:19.320
A light so bright that it can't be hidden
Breaks the silence and resurrects in this world

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:30.070
The dry land quakes violently
Sparks clash as we risk our lives

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.790
Let a miracle occur, just one more time

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:44.950
The power to regain the pages of memories I lost long ago

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:53.020
The trusting heart pierces the darkness
Search for the place where the soul rests

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:59.250
The sharp glint in my unblinking eye burns

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:06.700
Two souls - light and shadow
To the future shown in the crystal

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:13.310
Now moving  Overflowing in red  eyes

00:01:29.180 --> 00:01:33.540
I went to Kul Elna's underground temple to find Bakura.

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:37.000
And learned the secret of the Millennium Items' creation.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:42.410
I can't believe that happened - the Items were created for peace!

00:01:42.410 --> 00:01:48.080
Mahad resurrected, but Diabound gained the power of the spirits to punish him.

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:49.860
At this rate...

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:53.440
That's... Mana!

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:59.430
The End of Bandit King Bakura

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:05.660
Master!

00:02:05.660 --> 00:02:09.070
Mana, you saved me.

00:02:09.070 --> 00:02:13.220
I see you've been training in my absence.

00:02:13.220 --> 00:02:13.820
Yes!

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:23.100
Stand your ground!

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:34.520
Shada!

00:02:34.530 --> 00:02:36.880
Leave this to me!

00:02:36.880 --> 00:02:39.220
The Pharaoh went to the underground temple.

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:40.240
Thanks.

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:42.410
We're counting on you, Shada.

00:02:42.410 --> 00:02:44.700
Spirits!  Bring it on!

00:02:46.780 --> 00:02:47.860
Charge!

00:02:53.440 --> 00:02:54.460
Mana!

00:02:54.460 --> 00:02:55.340
Prince!

00:02:56.260 --> 00:02:58.490
Another weakling to deal with.

00:02:58.490 --> 00:03:00.560
Let's go, Mana!

00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:02.160
Yes, Master!

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:04.110
Take this, Bakura!

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:05.930
Rapid Fire Magic!

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:18.240
Since my Diabound is protected by the spirits, your Heka attacks don't work against it!

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:31.980
More Diabounds?

00:03:31.980 --> 00:03:33.100
He has three!

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:38.830
By gaining the spirits' power, Diabound has gained new effects.

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:43.520
Rapid Fire Magic!

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:49.680
Too bad!  You hit the wrong ones!

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:51.360
Helical Shockwave!

00:03:57.510 --> 00:03:58.920
Prince!

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:02.900
This will end you!

00:04:05.900 --> 00:04:07.220
Magic Crown!

00:04:10.900 --> 00:04:12.240
What?

00:04:12.240 --> 00:04:14.830
Diabound, keep attacking!

00:04:22.640 --> 00:04:23.870
Prince!

00:04:26.510 --> 00:04:28.450
Die, Yugi!

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:36.360
What?

00:04:38.850 --> 00:04:40.060
Pharaoh!

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:41.350
Everyone!

00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:44.500
Pharaoh!

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:47.940
Well well, if it isn't the priests.

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:49.860
Are you okay?

00:04:49.860 --> 00:04:50.940
Yes.

00:04:52.720 --> 00:04:53.870
Mahad.

00:04:55.480 --> 00:04:56.810
Isis.

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:59.520
You’ve resurrected.

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:05.450
Yes.  My body has died, but my soul will defend the Pharaoh forever.

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:07.220
Well done, Mahad!

00:05:07.220 --> 00:05:10.180
You truly are the most powerful spellcaster.

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:15.200
Let's not celebrate our reunion until we defeat Bakura.

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:22.240
Isis, the Pharaoh doesn't have much Ba left.

00:05:22.240 --> 00:05:23.440
I know.

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:25.210
Mystical Elf!

00:05:35.790 --> 00:05:38.590
Her white magic Ka regenerates Ba.

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:40.640
Bakura!

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:44.600
Pharaoh, you’re in no condition to fight.

00:05:44.600 --> 00:05:47.220
Leave this to the priests.

00:05:48.290 --> 00:05:53.100
So you came here with your Millennium Items.

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:56.210
Saves me the trouble of going after them.

00:05:56.210 --> 00:06:01.490
Bakura, the priests will end your foolish schemes!

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:03.150
Come out!

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:05.490
Curse of Dragon!

00:06:08.650 --> 00:06:11.460
Bring it on, priests!

00:06:11.460 --> 00:06:15.090
Diabound, defeat them all!

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:20.340
Surround Diabound and attack together!

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:28.460
They did it!

00:06:31.400 --> 00:06:32.810
Impossible!

00:06:32.810 --> 00:06:35.350
It repelled our attacks?

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:38.350
Pointless.

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:41.780
This location gives me a huge advantage.

00:06:41.780 --> 00:06:47.060
The spirits here hate Aknamkanon.

00:06:47.060 --> 00:06:50.220
They side with me and Diabound.

00:06:50.650 --> 00:06:54.670
You can't pierce this shield of spirits.

00:07:06.010 --> 00:07:09.680
Those disgusting memories are returning...

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:19.730
But this is where my Seto will become the Pharaoh.

00:07:23.950 --> 00:07:27.280
Spirits of Kul Elna, stay back!

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:32.100
Aknadin!

00:07:32.960 --> 00:07:35.900
Aknadin, are you okay?

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:38.240
I’m fine.

00:07:38.240 --> 00:07:41.580
The Pharaoh and the others went to Bakura.

00:07:41.580 --> 00:07:42.850
We must also-

00:07:43.950 --> 00:07:45.660
What is it, Shada?

00:07:45.660 --> 00:07:48.180
What's this power?

00:07:51.540 --> 00:07:55.330
Aknadin, please wait here.

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:57.060
Shada!

00:08:14.120 --> 00:08:17.550
What lies ahead?

00:08:24.530 --> 00:08:26.450
Millennium Key!

00:08:27.380 --> 00:08:28.810
This is...

00:08:36.210 --> 00:08:38.520
It's Diabound’s tablet.

00:08:39.190 --> 00:08:41.130
Aknadin!

00:08:41.130 --> 00:08:45.840
So the spirits of this village created Diabound.

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:50.280
Diabound is invincible, unless we extinguish their hate.

00:08:50.280 --> 00:08:54.430
Bur if we destroy this tablet, Diabound will be gone.

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:58.140
Two-Headed Jackal Warrior-

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:17.350
Aknadin...

00:09:23.800 --> 00:09:29.020
I won’t let you change my and Seto’s futures.

00:09:33.930 --> 00:09:35.730
What now, Seto?

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:40.060
If you won’t attack, I will!

00:09:40.060 --> 00:09:42.530
Go, Diabound!

00:09:42.530 --> 00:09:44.460
Poison Fang Barrage!

00:09:50.660 --> 00:09:54.080
You can no longer regenerate your Ba!

00:09:55.250 --> 00:09:57.700
Are you okay, Isis?

00:09:57.700 --> 00:09:59.540
I’m fine.

00:10:03.580 --> 00:10:12.170
Once I end them, I need the other Yugi to quickly find the eighth key.

00:10:12.610 --> 00:10:19.480
Good thing I was randomly able to implant my other self into him.

00:10:42.670 --> 00:10:45.310
Bobasa is hungry.

00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:46.620
Don't say that!

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:47.790
You're making it worse.

00:10:50.860 --> 00:10:53.880
They’re creepy.

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:56.120
They’re not chasing us anymore.

00:10:56.120 --> 00:11:01.740
After we split up with my other self, they've had plenty of chances to attack us.

00:11:02.380 --> 00:11:06.450
They must be afraid of me!  ...Maybe?

00:11:08.770 --> 00:11:09.980
What's wrong, Honda?

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:11.890
Huh?  Well...

00:11:11.890 --> 00:11:17.210
Yugi, we should get back to our mission.

00:11:17.210 --> 00:11:20.670
I never knew you were the responsible type!

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:22.130
I guess I am.

00:11:22.130 --> 00:11:24.370
Honda’s right.

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:29.400
If we don’t know what to do, we can't help the other Yugi.

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:33.050
I was just thinking.

00:11:33.050 --> 00:11:38.350
Instead of searching for it, maybe we overlooked something.

00:11:38.350 --> 00:11:40.280
Overlook something?

00:11:40.280 --> 00:11:42.940
Honda, you're talking nonsense!

00:11:42.940 --> 00:11:45.790
Actually, Honda may be right.

00:11:47.220 --> 00:11:50.490
Why didn’t I realize this sooner?

00:11:50.490 --> 00:11:53.580
Actually, I did realize it!

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:58.160
I just didn't think it was important!

00:11:59.660 --> 00:12:02.160
What do you mean, Yugi?

00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:09.860
Even before coming to this world, there's one thing we've never known.

00:12:09.860 --> 00:12:12.840
Something we've never known?

00:12:13.970 --> 00:12:15.460
Do you mean…

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:18.730
Yeah.  My other self's name.

00:12:18.730 --> 00:12:20.960
Is that important?

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:22.880
Think back.

00:12:27.090 --> 00:12:32.810
Why was my other self's name erased from the Tablet of Memories?

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:36.060
There must've been a reason why.

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:37.170
That’s right.

00:12:37.170 --> 00:12:43.010
This world is based on my other self's memories from 3,000 years ago.

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:49.010
Shadi said my other self's true enemy was Zorc.

00:12:53.730 --> 00:13:01.860
If my other self is destined to fight Zorc in this world, just as he did 3,000 years ago...

00:13:01.860 --> 00:13:05.800
Does that mean the other Yugi's name is...

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:09.980
Yes.  The key to defeating Zorc.

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:18.990
If I'm right, if my other self battles Zorc without knowing his own name...

00:13:18.990 --> 00:13:20.960
He can't win this game.

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:22.260
Are you serious?

00:13:22.260 --> 00:13:25.740
That's horrible!  Let's go find it!

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:27.920
But where?

00:13:27.920 --> 00:13:33.370
The other Yugi said no one in this world knows the Pharaoh’s name.

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:36.090
Let’s head back to town for now.

00:13:36.090 --> 00:13:41.540
Since we met my other self, we may be able to enter the palace.

00:13:41.540 --> 00:13:45.050
The palace...  There could be a lead there.

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:48.750
All right!  Then let’s go!

00:13:49.800 --> 00:13:51.740
Wait up, Honda!

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:56.180
Don’t leave Bobasa behind!

00:13:57.150 --> 00:13:58.680
Aura Sword!

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:04.570
I'll strike you back!  Take this!

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:17.980
Our Ka's attacks aren’t hurting Diabound!

00:14:17.980 --> 00:14:22.400
Seto, use my Millennium Scale's power!

00:14:24.280 --> 00:14:25.620
And fuse Ka together?

00:14:25.620 --> 00:14:26.490
Yes!

00:14:26.490 --> 00:14:31.070
We'll face him with our Ka's combined power!

00:14:32.780 --> 00:14:36.990
Millennium Scale, unite our Ka's powers!

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:45.940
Come out, Duos Dragon!

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:58.280
Mahad adds his power to Duos Dragon, tripling its attack strength!

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:03.220
Fusing weaklings will do nothing against Diabound!

00:15:03.220 --> 00:15:05.180
Here we go, Bakura!

00:15:05.180 --> 00:15:07.040
Dragon Flame!

00:15:09.710 --> 00:15:12.050
Fire back, Diabound!

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:13.660
Helical Shockwave!

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:22.210
Their attack strengths are equal!

00:15:22.210 --> 00:15:25.200
Equal?  Don't make me laugh!

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:30.140
If you're fusing your Ka, I’ll fuse my attacks!

00:15:30.140 --> 00:15:33.580
Magical Shockwave Thunder Force!

00:15:39.360 --> 00:15:41.420
What power!

00:15:43.610 --> 00:15:47.290
Destroy Duos Dragon, Diabound!

00:15:49.600 --> 00:15:51.060
Aura Sword!

00:15:54.210 --> 00:15:56.510
Using a sword as a shield?

00:15:57.170 --> 00:15:59.440
How long will that last?

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:04.300
Now, Karim!

00:16:04.680 --> 00:16:05.930
Dragon Flame!

00:16:13.860 --> 00:16:16.930
No way!  My shield of spirits is melting?

00:16:21.950 --> 00:16:23.370
We’re close, Seto!

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:26.300
Once we pierce the shield, we can destroy Diabound!

00:16:27.310 --> 00:16:29.120
Are you sure?

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:32.560
I still have plenty of Ba!

00:16:38.490 --> 00:16:39.790
Karim!

00:16:39.790 --> 00:16:43.450
No way…  Another Ka?

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:54.990
Without the Millennium Scale, your Ka can't stay fused together.

00:16:58.120 --> 00:16:59.870
Duos Dragon!

00:17:14.920 --> 00:17:15.950
Karim!

00:17:15.950 --> 00:17:18.960
I'm fine...  Look after the Pharaoh...

00:17:26.450 --> 00:17:29.060
I’ll use this immediately!

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:33.880
Millennium Scale, fuse Il Shu and Diabound!

00:17:47.390 --> 00:17:52.960
You can't quell the anger of these spirits!

00:17:54.100 --> 00:17:56.490
The spirits' anger?

00:17:56.490 --> 00:17:58.730
P-Prince...

00:18:02.680 --> 00:18:05.450
Pharaoh!

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:13.460
It's truly over, Yugi.

00:18:13.460 --> 00:18:16.740
The spirits want to be the ones to end you!

00:18:20.800 --> 00:18:24.730
Spirits, judge me.

00:18:24.730 --> 00:18:27.880
Pharaoh, what are you doing?

00:18:27.880 --> 00:18:32.700
Shimon, even if my father Aknamkanon was unaware...

00:18:32.700 --> 00:18:38.100
...many people were sacrificed for the Millennium Items.

00:18:38.100 --> 00:18:41.050
For the Millennium Items?

00:18:41.050 --> 00:18:46.480
If my friends meet the same fate, I'd hate myself too.

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:53.180
As the Pharaoh, it's my curse and destiny to be judged.

00:18:54.350 --> 00:18:58.610
As you wish, the sprits will devour your soul!

00:19:04.610 --> 00:19:05.500
Pharaoh!

00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:06.160
Prince!

00:19:07.600 --> 00:19:10.030
Die painfully, Yugi!

00:19:42.300 --> 00:19:43.700
What?

00:19:49.310 --> 00:19:51.570
Aknamkanon!

00:19:54.890 --> 00:19:56.850
Aknamkanon…

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:06.760
Impossible…  What's happening?

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:21.660
Diabound!

00:20:27.480 --> 00:20:29.050
Father…

00:20:31.970 --> 00:20:37.980
Aknamkanon's soul is attempting to lead the spirits to the afterlife.

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:43.050
Through regret and sadness, my father wants to save them in the end.

00:20:43.060 --> 00:20:46.990
Have you forgotten that you hate him?

00:20:46.990 --> 00:20:50.000
You should be tearing him to shreds!

00:20:52.360 --> 00:20:53.880
Father!

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:02.830
Father…

00:21:04.960 --> 00:21:06.940
Now, Mahad!

00:21:06.940 --> 00:21:09.950
Since Diabound lost its power…

00:21:17.470 --> 00:21:18.780
How dare you...

00:21:18.780 --> 00:21:21.720
I’ve been waiting for this day, Bakura!

00:21:21.720 --> 00:21:23.980
Magical Shockwave!

00:21:33.360 --> 00:21:36.540
Sleep for a millennium in shadows, Bakura!

00:21:59.270 --> 00:22:13.890
Right now, we don't need a map

00:22:14.050 --> 00:22:29.610
The miracle that tore through the darkness is in my hand

00:22:30.330 --> 00:22:35.450
Without a goal in mind

00:22:36.770 --> 00:22:44.020
We just step towards our dream

00:22:44.410 --> 00:22:49.660
EYE'S  As you sense it

00:22:49.850 --> 00:22:58.130
Your eye will find it

00:22:58.490 --> 00:23:03.940
Oh! EYE'S  What you wish for

00:23:04.730 --> 00:23:12.080
Will touch your soul

00:23:12.270 --> 00:23:15.340
In a duel

00:23:25.470 --> 00:23:28.760
Hooray!  He finally defeated Bakura!

00:23:28.760 --> 00:23:33.470
Akanadin shows up, but there's something wrong with him.

00:23:33.470 --> 00:23:37.800
Meanwhile, we go to the palace to find the Pharaoh's name.

00:23:37.800 --> 00:23:43.630
We were able to enter, but we can't touch anything or read the hieroglyphics.

00:23:43.630 --> 00:23:46.040
How are we supposed to find it?

00:23:46.040 --> 00:23:49.480
What?  We can't move!

00:23:49.480 --> 00:23:52.010
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
A New Stage

00:23:52.010 --> 00:23:53.380
Stay tuned!
